    "vocab-n5-study": ["study", "studying; to study (勉強する)", "In conversation, use 勉強する when you mean ‘to study.’"],
    "vocab-n4-prepare": ["preparation", "preparation; to prepare (準備する)", "Use 準備する for the action of getting something ready."],
